Copper Runtime (planned)
------------------------
Copper Runtime is planned as a Copper-branded, GPLv3-compatible derivative of
Termux components. No upstream Termux source or bootstrap binary is vendored in
this repository at the time of this notice. Before a runtime source import or
binary distribution, Copper will retain all applicable upstream copyrights and
license notices, publish corresponding source and patches, and include package-
specific notices for every redistributed package.

Pinned upstream sources and the implementation/compliance plan are recorded in:
- runtime/copper-runtime.lock.json
- docs/COPPER-RUNTIME.md

Upstream project: https://github.com/termux/termux-app
Upstream license notice: https://github.com/termux/termux-app/blob/master/LICENSE.md
